// Buildings stand on a planet's surface. `radius`: footprint in metres.
// `core`: a player who has no core building (and no colonizer) left is defeated.
// `extracts`: must be placed on a resource deposit and mines it at `rate` per second.
// `income`: resources per second while finished (metal, crystal, gas).
// `requires`: finished buildings the owner needs before this one can be started.
